# === Large / unreleased binaries (not cleared for versioning) ===
# Raw GIS/terrain/source archives and unreviewed binaries stay out until
# explicitly approved (rights audit + LFS decision). Add per-case exceptions
# deliberately with `!path` once approved.
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.tar.xz
*.tif
*.tiff
*.geotiff
*.asc
*.gpkg
*.shp
*.dem
*.hgt
*.uasset
*.umap
*.blend
*.blend1
*.fbx
*.psd
*.wav
*.mp4
*.mov
/LocalData/
/Archive/
/graphify-out
